---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Bi from "../../components/Bi.astro";

const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, "")}/`;
---

<Base
  title="偏度 / 峰度约束（中证 800） · Quant Research Portfolio"
  description="复现 SWS《量化组合的偏度问题》：先验证基线可信，再比较各类分域约束"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">
        <span data-i18n="zh">专题 · 中证 800 · 2021-01 – 2026-07 · 66 期</span>
        <span data-i18n="en">Study · CSI 800 · 2021-01 – 2026-07 · 66 periods</span>
      </p>
      <div class="hero-narrow">
        <Bi
          tag="h1"
          zh="偏度 / 峰度约束（中证 800）"
          en="Skew and kurtosis constraints (CSI 800)"
        />
        <Bi
          tag="p"
          class="lede"
          zh="复现原报告之前先确认基线：以生产风险模型与生产 alpha 重算的组合，与已上线组合的逐月权重高度一致。"
          en="Before reproducing the report, the baseline is confirmed first: rebuilt on the production risk model and production alpha, the portfolio matches the live one closely month by month."
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="rows">
        <div class="row">
          <span class="tag"><Bi tag="span" zh="原报告方法" en="Source method" /></span>
          <div class="body">
            <Bi
              tag="p"
              zh="原报告以四套等权因子合成组合（P1 八因子、P2 成长 + 动量 + 低波 + 红利、P3 成长 + 动量 + 分析师、P4 低波 + 反转 + 低流动性）在中证 500 上讨论组合偏度：先观察波动与极值暴露的方向，再以分层偏离或中性化约束修正；个股偏离 0.5%、行业偏离不超过 2%。"
              en="The report studies portfolio skew on CSI 500 through four equally weighted factor-composite portfolios (P1 an eight-factor mix, P2 growth/momentum/low-vol/dividend, P3 growth/momentum/analyst, P4 low-vol/reversal/low-liquidity): it reads the direction of volatility and tail exposure, then corrects it with layered deviation or neutralisation constraints, at 0.5% per-name and at most 2% industry deviation."
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="tag"><Bi tag="span" zh="本文调整" en="Adaptation" /></span>
          <div class="body">
            <Bi
              tag="p"
              zh="组合口径改为生产 alpha 与生产风险模型，基线采用已上线的存量组合（prod_reference）而非原报告组合；个股偏离放宽至 3%、不施加行业约束；约束方案扩展至九套逐一扫描，TE 上限 15%、单边成本 5bp。"
              en="Portfolios are rebuilt on the production alpha and production risk model, with the live stored portfolio (prod_reference) as the baseline instead of the report's composites; per-name deviation widens to 3% with no industry constraint; and the sweep grows to nine constraint schemes under a 15% TE cap and 5bp one-way costs."
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="tag"><Bi tag="span" zh="主要结论" en="Result" /></span>
          <div class="body">
            <Bi
              tag="p"
              zh="逐月持仓权重相关系数均值 0.9971、中位数 1.0000、最低 0.9627（67 期）；年化超额 4.83% 对 4.76%，实现 TE 8.02% 对 8.03%，差异仅来自约束口径。生产组合的波动 SSD 为 0.0652，方向为低波超配：最低波组主动 +8.71%、最高波组主动 −9.20%、波动前 10% 主动 −5.78%。原报告的中证 500 组合为高波超配，方向相反，约束的经济含义因此不同。"
              en="Mean monthly weight correlation is 0.9971, median 1.0000 and minimum 0.9627 across 67 periods; annualised excess is 4.83% against 4.76% and realised TE 8.02% against 8.03%, so the differences come from the constraint alone. The production portfolio's volatility SSD is 0.0652 and it overweights low volatility: +8.71% active in the lowest-volatility bucket, −9.20% in the highest, −5.78% in the top volatility decile. The report's CSI 500 portfolio does the opposite, which makes the constraint mean something different here."
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="tag"><Bi tag="span" zh="实验口径" en="Setup" /></span>
          <div class="body">
            <Bi
              tag="p"
              zh="风险模型与暴露沿用生产保存的 149 因子协方差与特异波动，缺失时回退到本地 barra 39 因子简化模型；求解形式为最大化主动 alpha 的二阶锥问题。"
              en="Risk model and exposures come from the production 149-factor covariance and specific volatility, falling back to a local 39-factor Barra model when unavailable; the solve is a second-order cone problem maximising active alpha."
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="tag"><Bi tag="span" zh="局限与边界" en="Limits" /></span>
          <div class="body">
            <Bi
              tag="p"
              zh="基线可信只说明两套口径一致，不代表原报告的方向在本组合上有效；结论依赖生产 alpha 快照的可得性，并可能随风险模型更新而变化。"
              en="A trustworthy baseline only shows the two conventions agree; it does not make the report's direction work here. The result also depends on the production alpha snapshot being available and can move when the risk model is updated."
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pager">
        <a href={`${base}notes/domain-constraint-sweep/`}>
          <span data-i18n="zh">← 分域约束扫描</span>
          <span data-i18n="en">← Domain-constraint sweep</span>
        </a>
        <a href={`${base}notes/roe-quality-factors/`}>
          <span data-i18n="zh">下一则 · ROE 质量因子 →</span>
          <span data-i18n="en">Next · ROE quality factors →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
